From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Mon, 27 Oct 2014 00:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mac80211: preseve AP mode keys across STA reconnect

Used for AP+STA support in OpenWrt - preserve AP mode keys across STA reconnect

[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
 net/mac80211/cfg.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

--- a/net/mac80211/cfg.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/cfg.c
@@ -2108,12 +2108,6 @@ static int ieee80211_stop_ap(struct wiph
 	clear_bit(SDATA_STATE_OFFCHANNEL_BEACON_STOPPED, &sdata->state);
 	ieee80211_link_info_change_notify(sdata, link, changes);
 
-	ieee80211_remove_link_keys(link, &keys);
-	if (!list_empty(&keys)) {
-		synchronize_net();
-		ieee80211_free_key_list(local, &keys);
-	}
-
 	if (sdata->wdev.links[link_id].cac_started) {
 		chandef = link_conf->chanreq.oper;
 		wiphy_hrtimer_work_cancel(wiphy, &link->dfs_cac_timer_work);
